<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n202" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβροχ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unwetted, unmoistened,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				339
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sotion
				p.183
			</span></i> W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ πόντον ἄ. ἀΐσσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.143
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρομος</span>
			): c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					1.75
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χως</span>”
				<i>without getting wet,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.217
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wanting rain, waterless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1485
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρκαδίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Jov.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>not inundated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PHib.
				1.85
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				455
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
